# Comments, naming, and process

- Comment why, not what — do not narrate obvious code.
- Name things after the domain concept (shared schema vocabulary), not implementation details.

Before writing code: skim the relevant master prompt section and these rules. If a request conflicts, follow these documents and flag the conflict in the response rather than silently violating them.
